{"guide":{"questionsToConsider":["Which kinds of shoot do you take on, and which would you rather not be asked about?","How far will you travel, and should the location question mention it?","Do commercial clients need to tell you about usage rights up front, or will you cover that in the quote?","Would you rather share packages first or ask about budget first?"],"howToUseResponses":"Check the date and whether it's flexible before anything else, since that decides whether you reply with a quote or a polite no. Use the coverage and usage answers to pick which package or licence to send. The how did you find me question shows you over time which venues, planners and past clients send the most work, so you know who to thank.","customizeSteps":["Edit the shoot types to your specialities and the coverage options to the packages you sell.","Change the budget options or remove the question if you publish your prices.","Put the form on your website's contact page and link it from your social profiles."],"faqs":[{"q":"What should a photography contact form ask?","a":"The type of shoot, the date, the location, how many people and how the photos will be used. For weddings, add how much of the day to cover."},{"q":"Why ask how the photos will be used?","a":"Commercial use affects the licence and the price. Knowing whether images are for a website, print or packaging lets you quote correctly the first time."},{"q":"Should I ask for a budget on a photography enquiry?","a":"A soft question works best. Clients who haven't set a budget can simply ask for your packages instead."},{"q":"Can I use this form for weddings and portraits at the same time?","a":"Yes. The first question sends couples to wedding coverage and commercial clients to usage questions, while portraits and events go straight to the date."}]},"doc":{"schemaVersion":9,"title":"Photography enquiry","description":"Check your calendar and send a quote from the first message.","blocks":[{"id":"blk_photogra00","ref":"welcome","title":"Hi! Tell me about the shoot you have in mind and I'll check my availability.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"buttonLabel":"Start","type":"welcome"},{"id":"blk_photogra01","ref":"shoot_type","title":"What kind of shoot is it?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_wedding_or_elopement","label":"Wedding or elopement","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_portrait_couple_or","label":"Portrait, couple or family","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_event","label":"Event","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_product_or_commercial","label":"Product or commercial","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_headshots","label":"Headshots","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_something_else","label":"Something else","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_photogra02","ref":"coverage","title":"How much of the day would you like covered?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_ceremony_only","label":"Ceremony only","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_ceremony_and_portraits","label":"Ceremony and portraits","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_getting_ready_through","label":"Getting ready through to first dance","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_the_whole_day","label":"The whole day","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_photogra03","ref":"usage","title":"Where will the photos be used?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"multi_select","options":[{"id":"opt_website_or_online","label":"Website or online shop","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_social_media","label":"Social media","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_print_ads_or","label":"Print ads or brochures","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_packaging","label":"Packaging","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_press","label":"Press","image_key":null}],"minSelections":1,"maxSelections":10,"allowOther":false}